{"t":"Ice Islands","s":"ice-islands-2fc09","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Southern_Ice_Islands_bb766e.jpg","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ice Islands</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Southern Ice Islands\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"203\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Southern_Ice_Islands_bb766e.jpg\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">North: Jarl</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwelling%20of%20the%20Forgotten\">Dwelling of the Forgotten</a></li><li>Formorgar Glacier Crystal Spiders</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Glacier%2FMammoths\">Formorgar Glacier Mammoths</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grotto%20of%20the%20Lost\">Grotto of the Lost</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Otherworld\">Otherworld</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-test-quest\">Barbarian Test Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/nimmersatts-lair\">Nimmersatt's Lair</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.2<br/>June 10, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">More images</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map2\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Northern Ice Islands\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"89\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Northern_Ice_Islands_0bbebc.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Southern Ice Islands Map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"112\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Southern_Ice_Islands_Map_0f4a57.png\" width=\"125\"/></span></p><p><br/> </p><p><br/> </p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Ice Islands</b> are two sets of islands to the north of the main Tibia continent, in the Nordic Ocean.  Because of the islands' low temperature, they are permanently covered with snow and ice. They are located:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Southern: Northwest of Carlin, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32075,31669,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32075, 31669, 7)</a>;</li>\n<li>Northern: North of Carlin, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32287,31271,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32287, 31271, 7)</a>.</li></ul>\n<p>One set of islands is the Southern Ice Islands, which are very small and accessible to players with free accounts. The Northern Ice Islands (or just Ice Islands) were added in the Summer 2007 update and include many larger islands and the city of <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Southern_Ice_Islands\">Southern Ice Islands</span></h2>\n<p>The Southern Ice Islands consist of <a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a>, and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Arctic%20Faun%27s%20Island\">Arctic Faun's Island</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a> has a large dungeon with <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Troll\">Frost Trolls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a> and if you go deep enough, <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime\">Slimes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mages</a>, minor <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20Elemental\">Water Elementals</a>. There are even <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelords</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpions</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a> and all kinds of minotaurs in the hidden cave. \n</p><p>You can go to any of the three main islands taking the <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32235,31678,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Nordic Ferry (32235, 31678, 7)</a> located at the northwest of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>. The price is 20 gp from the Continent to any island, 10 gp, island-to-island and the passage back to the Continent is free.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Arctic%20Faun%27s%20Island\">Arctic Faun's Island</a> can be accessed if you take a shortcut from captain <a href=\"#/wiki/Charles\">Charles</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> and end up shipwrecking there (this is random). \n</p><p>Locations of <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32163,31656,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Senja (32163, 31656, 7)</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32023,31579,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Folda (32023, 31579, 7)</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31991,31700,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Vega (31991, 31700, 7)</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32115,31739,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Arctic Faun's Island (32115, 31739, 7)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32248,31588,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Nimmersatt's Lair (32248, 31588, 7)</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Northern_Ice_Islands\">Northern Ice Islands</span></h2>\n<p>These were added for premium players in the Summer Update 2007 and consist of <a href=\"#/wiki/Grimlund\">Grimlund</a>, with the Chakoya settlement of <a href=\"#/wiki/Inukaya\">Inukaya</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Helheim\">Helheim</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hrodmir\">Hrodmir</a>, with the city of <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Krimhorn\">Krimhorn</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Okolnir\">Okolnir</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Tyrsung\">Tyrsung</a>. Many new <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creatures</a> and quests can be found in these areas.\n</p></div>","quests":["demons-lullaby","nimmersatts-lair"]}